.TH MYLOAI 1 "2026-09-08" "MyLoAI Control Center 1.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
myloai \- MyLoAI Control Center desktop application
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B myloai
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
MyLoAI Control Center is a native PySide6 desktop application for managing local and remote LLM backends and models.
.PP
The canonical Linux command is
.B myloai .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-help
Show command-line help.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Show the installed MyLoAI version.
.SH CONFIGURATION
Application configuration, data, sessions, plugins, and logs are stored in platform-native per-user directories. Use Help \(-> Diagnostics in the graphical application to inspect exact paths.
.SH BACKENDS
MyLoAI supports Ollama, OpenAI-compatible APIs, and llama.cpp-compatible servers. Backend availability is determined by the local system and configured endpoints.
.SH FILES
The installed package contains only production runtime files, required resources, redistribution notices, and this user-facing manual.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ollama (1)
